cwen-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"CWEN 2024 Q4","e":"cwen","d":"2025-02-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Craig Cornelius","x":"Looking ahead to 2025, we've reaffirmed our 2025 guidance range and have gained further confidence in our ability to meet the midpoint or better of that range through CAFD expected to be contributed by committed investments and the ongoing strength in the performance of our fleet.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/24/clearway-energy-cwen-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"CWEN 2025 Q4","e":"cwen","d":"2026-02-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Craig Cornelius","x":"…existence proof of the recent offerings from Royal Slope and Swan, which were made in the course of the current month, certainly after we have seen a share price increase for CWEN, each of those were offered within that same 10% to 11% CAFD yield range where assets were being offered last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/23/clearway-energy-cwen-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CWEN 2026 Q1","e":"cwen","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sarah Rubenstein","x":"Turning to Slide 15, I will cover our first quarter financial results and our reaffirmed outlook for 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/clearway-cwen-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CWEN 2026 Q2","e":"cwen","d":"2026-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Anaha Elliott","x":"And then additionally, how are you thinking about the Section 232 and the subsequent inflation risks as it relates to this agreement with T1?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/clearway-energy-cwen-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CWEN 2026 Q2","e":"cwen","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Craig Cornelius","x":"But depending on the resource mix and location and the novelty value of one of these complexes, it's conceivable that